  "esp.bonito.curiosidad": {"en": "The bonito from Burela and the Galician coast is caught with a rod, one by one — certified sustainable fishing. In summer, the fish markets are filled with its pink flesh.", "gl": "O bonito de Burela e o da costeira galega péscase con cana, un a un — pesca sostible certificada. No verán as lonxas énchense da súa carne rosada."},
